---
description: SCSS modules + global tokens
globs: apps/web/**/*.{scss,tsx}
---

Full rules: @docs/CONVENTIONS.md

- Component styles are colocated SCSS modules: `<Component>.module.scss` next to `<Component>.tsx`.
- Globals live in `src/app/styles/{variables,globals}.scss`. Imported once from `src/app/layout.tsx`.
- Media queries use breakpoint variables from `variables.scss`. No magic pixel values.
- No global class names from inside a module. Use `.module.scss` always.
- No inline `style={}` except for runtime-only values (chart dimensions, computed heights).
- Shared mixins → `src/app/styles/mixins.scss`, created when the second consumer appears, not before.
